<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,434.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,434.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,434 today from 1,425 on Feb 10, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1493    13.557	  1485    13.479</p>
<p>   1a   1505 11400.000	  1492 11300.000</p>
